464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (throughout my career as a Mobile Developer, I have gained extensive experience in creating a wide range of applications using technologies like Flutter, Flutterflow, Kotlin, and React Native. My professional journey began with developing event management applications for Digital Amoeba and PT Barrans Global Mandiri, where I honed my skills in building intuitive user interfaces and managing event related features. Since then, I have built comprehensive HR solutions for both PT Swamedia Informatika and Telkom Indonesia, creating tools to streamline various processes. My experience also extends to freelance work on Upwork, where I've continued to develop HR applications alongside projects for mental health, showcasing my versatility and adaptability. Most recently, I've taken on the development of the Ferizy B2C application at PT ASDP, a large scale project that further expands my expertise into consumer facing platforms. This diverse background highlights my ability to deliver high quality applications across different domains and my dedication to continuous learning.)
/E (throughout my career as a Mobile Developer, I have gained extensive experience in creating a wide range of applications using technologies like Flutter, Flutterflow, Kotlin, and React Native. My professional journey began with developing event management applications for Digital Amoeba and PT Barrans Global Mandiri, where I honed my skills in building intuitive user interfaces and managing event related features. Since then, I have built comprehensive HR solutions for both PT Swamedia Informatika and Telkom Indonesia, creating tools to streamline various processes. My experience also extends to freelance work on Upwork, where I've continued to develop HR applications alongside projects for mental health, showcasing my versatility and adaptability. Most recently, I've taken on the development of the Ferizy B2C application at PT ASDP, a large scale project that further expands my expertise into consumer facing platforms. This diverse background highlights my ability to deliver high quality applications across different domains and my dedication to continuous learning.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8 9 10]
>>
